  "design_notes": [
    "Window-broken lower façade persists in both drawings. Two storeys provide a sea-level approach while the review camera emphasizes the roof.",
    "Collapsed tank cap is temporarily rotated in the damage stage. Finished structural modules use modelled taper and stay upright.",
    "Broken slabs reuse the repaired slab meshes, with separate debris disappearing as each zone settles.",
    "Render staging and collision proxies are separate from visual packages.",
    "The greenhouse glazing source budget was amended after measuring 42044 evaluated triangles. The detailed curved ribs and glazing are retained in the editable source. Game export optimization and performance budgets remain pending.",
    "A stable front row and side approaches connect the east upper landing, greenhouse frontage, tower-side apron and uphill house terrace across both states.",
    "The small house footprint is rotated by 7 degrees and its actual roof is sloped by 7 degrees per the revision. The central reference height is 3.1 m.",
    "Three nearby paving swatches and a blue-green painted steel tank use the shared warm timber PaletteUV image.",
    "The house close-up guides the recessed opening, exposed brick, roof rim, patched plaster and lantern canopy.",
    "House is a four-member family with a separate corner wall repair and damage assembly."
  ],
